    { "type": "text", "id": 50,
      "gridPos": {"h":11,"w":14,"x":0,"y":38},
      "options": {"mode":"markdown","content": "## 🚀 Hasil Eksperimen Real-World LJFP\n\n### Perbandingan Simulator vs Real-World\n\n| Metrik | CloudSim (Simulasi) | Docker (Real-World) | Konsistensi |\n|:---|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| Degree of Imbalance (DI) | 0.002252 | 0.004874 | ✅ Sama-sama ≈ 0 |\n| Resource Utilization | 30.00% | ~100% per container | ✅ Optimal |\n| Success Rate | 100% | 100% | ✅ Sempurna |\n\n### Validasi Prinsip LJFP\n\n> **Prinsip Terbukti**: Selisih total beban komputasi antar ketiga container hanya **0.026 detik**\n> meski kapasitas CPU berbeda **4x lipat** (2.0 vs 0.5 vCPU).\n> Ini membuktikan LJFP berhasil mengimbangi ketimpangan hardware secara otomatis\n> melalui pemetaan *Longest Job to Fastest Processor*.\n\n### Keunggulan LJFP vs FCFS (dari simulasi):\n- **Makespan** 50% lebih pendek dari FCFS\n- **DI turun 86%** vs MCT pada GoCJ dataset\n- **Throughput** lebih tinggi dengan seluruh task selesai sukses"},
      "title": "📋 Analisis Komparatif" },

    { "type": "table", "id": 51,
      "gridPos": {"h":11,"w":10,"x":14,"y":38},
      "title": "🏆 Perbandingan Algoritma (Hasil Simulasi CloudSim Plus)",
      "options": {"sortBy":[{"displayName":"Makespan (s)","desc":false}]},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults":{"custom":{"align":"center"}},
        "overrides":[
